(
    <Slide
        style={{
            width: 1280,
            height: 720,
            background: '#FFFFFF',
            position: 'relative',
            paddingTop: 52,
            paddingBottom: 52,
            paddingLeft: 72,
            paddingRight: 72,
        }}
    >
        <Box
            style={{
                position: 'relative',
                zIndex: 1,
                width: '100%',
                height: '100%',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                justifyContent: 'space-between',
            }}
        >
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', width: '100%' }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 48, height: 4, background: '#06B6D4' }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', letterSpacing: 4 }}>异 步</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#94A3B8' }}>11 / 26</Text>
                </Box>

                <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 16 }}>
                    为什么请求之后不能立刻拿到数据
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', width: '100%', gap: 26 }}>
                <Box
                    style={{
                        flex: 1,
                        background: '#F1F5F9',
                        borderRadius: 14,
                        paddingTop: 24,
                        paddingBottom: 24,
                        paddingLeft: 24,
                        paddingRight: 24,
                        flexDirection: 'column',
                    }}
                >
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                        <FAIcon name='ban' style={{ fill: '#94A3B8', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>同步（不要这样）</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
                        排队等。网络请求可能要几百毫秒甚至几秒，
                        这段时间页面会卡死、白屏、点不动。
                        <br />
                        就像在奶茶店柜台前干站着等，
                        后面所有人都别想点单。
                    </Text>
                    <Box
                        style={{
                            marginTop: 'auto',
                            alignSelf: 'flex-start',
                            background: '#FFFFFF',
                            borderRadius: 6,
                            paddingTop: 8,
                            paddingBottom: 8,
                            paddingLeft: 14,
                            paddingRight: 14,
                        }}
                    >
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#94A3B8' }}>
                            页面卡住不动
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box
                    style={{
                        flex: 1,
                        background: 'rgba(6,182,212,0.10)',
                        borderRadius: 14,
                        paddingTop: 24,
                        paddingBottom: 24,
                        paddingLeft: 24,
                        paddingRight: 24,
                        flexDirection: 'column',
                    }}
                >
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                        <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#0891B2', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>异步（正确做法）</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
                        先取号，去旁边坐着，叫号了再来拿。
                        等待期间页面照常渲染、照常响应点击。
                        <br />
                        数据到了之后，再执行"渲染"这个动作。
                    </Text>
                    <Box
                        style={{
                            marginTop: 'auto',
                            alignSelf: 'flex-start',
                            background: '#FFFFFF',
                            borderRadius: 6,
                            paddingTop: 8,
                            paddingBottom: 8,
                            paddingLeft: 14,
                            paddingRight: 14,
                        }}
                    >
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#0891B2' }}>
                            页面不卡
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: '100%', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box
                    style={{
                        background: '#FFFFFF',
                        borderWidth: 1,
                        borderColor: '#E2E8F0',
                        borderRadius: 10,
                        paddingTop: 16,
                        paddingBottom: 16,
                        paddingLeft: 22,
